 "remarks": "Seeing is believing! This Townhome checks almost every box. It's modern with tasteful finishes. Enter and let the shadow boxes and chair rail escort you up and into the living room with a feature wall fit for a large flatscreen TV. Relax in the living room and watch your favorite TV show with hardwood floors and a sunlit view. Hungry? Make your way over to the updated kitchen featuring a stone backsplash, plenty of cabinetry, white countertop, hardwood flooring, stainless steel appliances and a view of outside. Your guests don't have to go upstairs to use the restroom. On the main level, the New York City themed powder room will take your imagination out of Connecticut and put you on 6th Avenue. Upstairs, you can relax your feet after a long day on the new soft carpet with two bedrooms and ample closet space. The large primary bedroom features two closets with shelving system, TV connections in case you don't want to go downstairs, double crown molding and two extended length windows for plenty of light. Comfort you ask? There's comfort, style and function in the hall bath with marble floor tiles, marble tiles in the shower and a glass door opener. Within the bathroom, find the newer washer and dryer for ease of keeping clothes clean. Outside, you'll have convenience with a dedicated parking space in front of the unit and a dedicated garage, large enough for a car and some storage.",
